\par\par \b \uc2 PBOC\uc2  Chief Says China Moving Ahead With Reforms\b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 2013\par 06:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires Korean (English)\par \uc2 RTNWK\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said Tuesday that Beijing is moving ahead with plans to liberalize domestic interest rates and reduce its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the state-run \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  Securities Journal's website reported.\par \par \uc2 In a speech at a financial forum, \uc2 People's Bank of China\uc2  Governor \uc2 Zhou Xiaochuan\uc2  repeated statements that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is focusing on liberalizing deposit rates and wants to withdraw from routine \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Zhou also was cited as saying that China will speed its move toward capital account covertibility in order to facilitate overseas trade and investment by domestic companies.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief also called for expanded quotas under the qualified domestic institutional investors and qualified foreign institutional investors programs, which cover inbound and outbound investments by institutions.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Zhou had previously pointed to these same reform goals in an article in a newly published book designed to explain decisions taken at a policy-setting meeting of Communist Party leaders earlier this month. He didn't provide any timeline on the reforms in the article or in his reported remarks.\par \par \uc2 Newspaper website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://news.cnstock.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://news.cnstock.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Write to djnews.beijing@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Subscribe to WSJ: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires}}}\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 November 25, 2013 23:30 ET (04:30 GMT)\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 26-11-13 0558GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNWK00020131126e9bq00008\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
