\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-ANALYSIS-Rally in tightly managed yuan shows China leery of  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  reform\b0\par\par\uc2 1,048 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Oktober 2013\par 00:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Repeats story first carried late on Thursday)\par \par \uc2 * China c.bank has allowed strong yuan despite weak exports\par \par \uc2 * Reform trajectory will not be "disturbed by outside noises" - c.bank researcher\par \par \uc2 * Regulators continue to manipulate the exchange rate through massive \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Beijing offsetting strong yuan through other policy preferences for industries\par \par \uc2 By Pete Sweeney and \uc2 Aileen Wang\par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI/BEIJING, Oct 17 (Reuters) - China's tolerance for a sustained yuan rally is reinforcing its commitment to wean the economy off of an export dependence, but unapologetic market meddling to hold back the pace of appreciation shows deep wariness of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  liberalisation.\par \par \uc2 The decision by the \uc2 People's Bank of China (PBOC) \uc2 to allow market forces to push the yuan up more than 2 percent against the dollar in 2013 has increased pressure on domestic exporters, who once relied on a weak yuan to boost price competitiveness, in support of efforts to restructure the economy to one that is led more by services.\par \par \uc2 But the tightly choreographed nature of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise undermines hopes that Beijing is finally ready to let capital flow freely in and out of the country, another area of reform high on the wish list of many Western nations.\par \par \uc2 China's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves exploded by upward of $163 billion in the third quarter of 2013, the largest absolute increase on record and the biggest percentage rise since February 2007. The increase reflects market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the yuan from rising too quickly, which could attract more speculative inflows.\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 PBOC\uc2  has been purchasing \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a frantic rate in recent weeks, underlining again how reluctant policymakers are to leave the renminbi in the hands of market forces," said Mark Williams and \uc2 Qinwei Wang\uc2  of Capital Economics, referring to the official name of China's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Among many other implications, this suggests that capital account liberalisation is a long way off," they wrote in a client research note.\par \par \uc2 China's traded exchange rate has set record highs against the dollar for four days in a row this week.\par \par \uc2 Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has appeared in recent sessions to suspend its use of intermediaries to quietly buy up dollars in the spot market, a practice that had effectively put appreciation on a leash in the spot market in the third quarter.\par \par \uc2 But traders say this reversal looks more like a tactical retreat - the dollar faced strong selling pressure globally amid the U.S. debt-ceiling showdown - rather than a shift towards letting market forces set the yuan's value.\par \par \uc2 COMMITTED\par \par \uc2 The rally occurred despite export data showing an unexpected 0.3 percent annual decline in September, which confounded market expectations for a 6 percent rise. Recent comments though by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicate that investment-related capital inflows, rather than the trade surplus, is the source of upward pressure on the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Central bankers have insisted they are committed to reducing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is already on its reform trajectory as scheduled and will not be disturbed by outside noises," said a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  researcher, who asked not to be identified because he is not allowed to speak to the media.\par \par \uc2 "It is impossible and unrealistic to keep adjusting our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates solely following export figures."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor \uc2 Yi Gang\uc2  said in March that \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  had reduced its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market and that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy would be more flexible in 2013.\par \par \uc2 But the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves data shows that the bank has continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it sees fit to prevent undue fluctuations in the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, suggestions by regulators that the \uc2 PBOC\uc2  would widen the yuan's 2 percent trading band to allow more volatility into the market sometime during the summer have led to disappointment; apart from this week's rally, intraday volatility has been minimal since August, which traders say is due to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 REASONABLE CAUTION\par \par \uc2 Multinational firms are eager for Beijing to make it easier to repatriate their China earnings back to headquarters, but many domestic economists share Beijing's caution about yuan liberalisation.\par \par \uc2 "I am a very strong reformer except for capital flows, and that should not be equated to pro-reform or not pro-reform," said Wang Tao, an economist at \uc2 UBS\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "I would think the biggest reforms are to the domestic financial system, domestic state-owned enterprises, pricing systems, fiscal systems; those are very important. In the mean time, having some sort of insulation between domestic issues and external shocks by maintaining controls on short-term capital flows is a good thing."\par \par \uc2 She points to the fractious state of a U.S. political system that saw American lawmakers contemplate defaulting on outstanding debts in the service of a purely domestic policy debate. China is one of America's biggest creditors.\par \par \uc2 That reinforces the long-term case for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reforms, which would reduce China's dependence on the dollar, Wang argues. But it also supports those who say retaining short-term controls will prevent money from washing in and out of China willy nilly while its economic recovery remains delicate, she said.\par \par \uc2 RESISTANT TO CHANGE\par \par \uc2 So far, the economy's growth drivers have not shown signs of any fundamental shift, even with the yuan strengthening by 4.43 percent over the past two years.\par \par \uc2 Economists polled by Reuters expect data on Friday to show little adjustment in the ratio between retail sales and fixed-asset investment, which some use as a proxy for China's progress in economic restructuring.\par \par \uc2 For the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , government measures to support a slowing economy have bought time by satisfying some Chinese managers that a strong yuan will not lead to immediate bankruptcy because Beijing will help them in other ways.\par \par \uc2 "As far as my company is concerned, I think we can accept the appreciation pace of the renminbi this year," said Ye Xiangyu, general manager of People Electronic Appliance Group in Wenzhou.\par \par \uc2 "I would rather focus on the government's supportive measures than on the movements of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate." (Editing by Neil Fullick)\par \par \uc2 CHINA-YUAN/REFORM (ANALYSIS,REPEAT) | Z | G | RBN | C | D | E | M | O | U | MTL | GRO | SOF | OIL   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020131017e9ah0015r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
