\par\par \b \uc2 WSJ.COM What's News - Worldwide News Briefs\b0\par\par\uc2 491 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 2013\par 23:14\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par NORTH SEA HELICOPTER CRASH PROBE ONGOING \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.K. air crash investigators said it was too early to identify the causes of last week's fatal helicopter crash in the U.K. North Sea. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par INDIA ARRESTS TERROR SUSPECT \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Indian authorities said they had captured an alleged founder of the organization \f28 \uc2 \f2 Indian Mujahideen\f28 \uc2 \f2 , which is accused of carrying out bomb attacks across India that have killed dozens of people. \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CHINA\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  REJECTS BLOC'S \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  IN CONFLICTS \par  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's defense minister issued a blunt rebuke to Southeast Asian counterparts, saying Beijing rejected any multilateral approach to resolving competing territorial claims in the South China Sea. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CHINA WATCHDOG SUSPENDS REFINERY APPROVALS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's environmental regulator halted new projects at the country's two largest refining companies, a sign of stepped-up environmental scrutiny of state-owned enterprises. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par INDIA LAND BILL CLEARS HURDLE \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Legislation would streamline a chaotic process to acquire land for industry or infrastructure costs but higher compensation for landowners would significantly raise costs involved. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par INDONESIA RAISES INTEREST RATES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  raised its main policy rate by a half-percentage point , reflecting a growing realization that defending the plunging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is a more pressing need than maintaining rapid economic growth. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par PHILIPPINE ECONOMY STANDS OUT \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Philippine economy grew strongly in the second quarter, underscoring how some Asian countries are riding out the emerging-markets turmoil with healthier fundamentals. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CONFIDENCE ADDS TO MOMENTUM \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Business confidence in the euro zone's No. 2 and 3 economies rose in August, bolstering evidence that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  area's nascent economic recovery is gaining momentum. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CHINESE CITIES TIGHTEN REINS ON HOME PURCHASES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Major Chinese cities are turning to fresh measures to temper home-buyer enthusiasm amid a renewed surge in housing prices, but analysts doubt the moves will halt the rise. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par GHANA COURT REJECTS ELECTION CHALLENGE \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The long-running courtroom drama had served as a civics lesson for people in this still-young democracy and across Africa. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par PAKISTANI CIA HELPER'S SENTENCE SET ASIDE \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The prison sentence handed down to the Pakistani doctor who allegedly helped the \f28 \uc2 \f2 U.S. Central Intelligence Agency\f28 \uc2 \f2  track down Osama bin Laden has apparently been overturned on appeal. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par PHILIPPINE BUSINESSWOMAN TO FACE TRIAL \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A Philippine court set the arraignment of Janet Lim Napoles, implicated in a sweeping corruption scandal, for Sept. 9 after she surrendered directly into the custody of President Benigno Aquino III. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par TALIBAN ATTACK U.S.-POLISH BASE \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A suicide bomber was followed by heavy gunfire, killing one coalition service member and several Afghan civilians and security guards. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BANK OF ENGLAND READY TO DO MORE --- CARNEY \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The head of the U.K. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  announced new measures to boost lending, but once again his message seems to have fallen on deaf ears in the markets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (For continuously updated news from the Wall Street Journal, see WSJ.com at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://wsj.com}}}\uc2 \f2 .)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 August 29, 2013 17:14 ET (21:14 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130829e98t004v9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
