ying a 1.4% fall by the yuan over the next year.\par \par \uc2 In the offshore yuan market in Hong Kong, where the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  floats freely, the dollar was at CNY6.2310, higher than CNY6.2248 late Monday.\par \par \uc2 Write to Wynne Wang at wynne.wang@dowjones.com [ 29-01-13 0932GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1153   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130129e91t000hw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
