178 late Monday, implying a 1.3% fall by the yuan over the next year.\par \par \uc2 In the offshore yuan market in Hong Kong, where the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  floats freely, the dollar was at CNY6.2105, lower than CNY6.2150 late Monday.\par \par \uc2 Write to Wynne Wang at wynne.wang@dowjones.com [ 18-12-12 0925GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1153   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121218e8ci000fr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
