\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Economic Stories of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Oktober 2012\par 03:02\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par DATA SNAP: AUSTRALIA INFLATION ROSE 1.2% IN 3Q FROM 2Q \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Australia's consumer-price index rose 1.2% in the third quarter of 2012 from the second quarter, and rose 2.0% from a year earlier, the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Australian Bureau of Statistics\f28 \uc2 \f2  said Wednesday. (published 0032 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par HKMA SELLS FURTHER HK$3.06 BLN TO WEAKEN HONG KONG DOLLAR \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sold a further 3.062 billion Hong Kong dollars Tuesday in New York trade to weaken the value of the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , its fourth \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in a week. (published 0041 GMT)\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CHINA\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  MAY LAUNCH RULES TO HELP BANKS EXPAND CHANNELS TO BOOST CAPITAL -REPORT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China is likely to launch by the end of the year new rules that give banks more ways to raise capital, which the authorities hope will boost credit growth, the state-run Shanghai Securities News reported Wednesday. (published 0052 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par WSJ: CHINA EDGES OUT U.S. AS TOP DESTINATION AMID FOREIGN-INVESTMENT DECLINE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Businesses curtailed new overseas investments in the first half of the year, another symptom of the global economic slowdown. (published 0002 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par UPDATE: SPENDING JUMPS 33% IN VENEZUELA'S 2013 BUDGET PROPOSAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Venezuelan government will seek to increase spending in 2013 by 33% from the previous year, Finance Minister Jorge Giordani announced Tuesday, as President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Hugo Chavez\f28 \uc2 \f2  pushes to deepen his self-styled revolution after winning re-election this month. (published 2339 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par GREECE WINS ANOTHER TWO YEARS TO FIX BUDGET - REPORT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Greek government will get another two years to fix its budget problems, German daily Sueddeutsche Zeitung reported in its Wednesday editions, citing a draft memorandum of understanding between Greece and its international lenders. (published 2154 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 24-10-12 0102GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1030 1804 4180   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121024e8ao0001k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
